Anthropic stock can now be bought on the Nasdaq under ticker ANT after the company's initial public offering priced at $83 per share on November 19, 2026. After opening at $111.50 on November 19, 2026, the stock closed down 6.5% on Tuesday, November 24, 2026, which sent shares below the $83 IPO price, according to [CNBC](https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/anthropic-stock-ipo-price.html).

To buy shares, place a market or limit order for ANT through any standard brokerage account. The retail IPO allocation is closed, which means all purchases now take place on the public secondary market. Because public trading has begun, private pre-IPO share solicitations are no longer valid, so review the pre-IPO scam warnings outlined below before transferring money anywhere.